(in addition to required)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Master’s degree in Analytics, Data sciences, or any quantitative discipline,&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with ecommerce analytics is a huge plus&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;High proficiency in building Tableau dashboards and executive friendly deliverables for business needs and to aid decision making&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Proficient in application of Statistical Methods&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Prior start up experience highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Ecommerce in any of the areas
